  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Bei Cao Chuan tells Liu Wen Wu that after Chang Shan Yin disappeared, Chang Biao married his wife and raised the three year old son who is now Chang tribe’s young tribe leader Chang Ji You, and that blood tie might be used against Wolf King.",
      "chapters": [
        527
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bei_cao_chuan",
        "char_liu_wen_wu",
        "char_chang_shan_yin",
        "char_chang_biao",
        "fac_chang_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chang Ji You is young and at the peak of his health.",
      "chapters": [
        535
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Although he kneels, his upper body is upright. He has an aquiline nose, dark brows, a broad back and a thin waist, giving him a heroic aura.",
      "chapters": [
        573
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Liu tribe camp Chang Ji You asks his mother what kind of person his father was, then leaves when Chang Biao enters. Alone with Ni Xue Tong, Chang Biao says Chang Ji You is their son from a secret liaison, that he and Ha Tu Gu plotted against Chang Shan Yin, and that he later married her and raised Chang Ji You as godson so the young tribe leader seat and their reputations would hold. He also says Chang Shan Yin still thinks the boy is his flesh and blood.",
      "chapters": [
        530
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bloodline-talk",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ha_tu_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He completely transforms into a heavenly zombie. The monstrous Chang Ji You kneels on the ground.",
      "chapters": [
        589
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-zombie",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Liu tribe loses, Chang Biao brings Ni Xue Tong and Chang Ji You to Fang Yuan under the Chang Shan Yin name. Chang Ji You has never met that father in person and is excited rather than afraid when they face him.",
      "chapters": [
        535
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "captive-meeting-and-tribe-seat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_liu_tribe",
        "char_ni_xue_tong",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan makes himself Chang tribe’s sole supreme elder, names Chang Ji You tribe leader, and leaves Chang Biao as number one elder. Chang Ji You is then only rank three and reads the seat as a test.",
      "chapters": [
        536
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "captive-meeting-and-tribe-seat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under Wolf King’s shade through the Imperial Court contest he later stands as a rank four Gu Master beside Ge Guang, still answering Fang Yuan with fanatical worship while reporting arrests on the battlefield.",
      "chapters": [
        573
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "captive-meeting-and-tribe-seat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "evt_arc_imperial_court_contest",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "char_ge_guang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan calls him son, gives yellow gold and purple crystal relic Gu, and uses blood skull Gu while he sleeps so his aptitude rises. Three days later Chang Ji You finishes the relics and reaches rank five upper stage, then practices six arm heavenly zombie king until he fully transforms into a heavenly zombie and begs Fang Yuan to save him.",
      "chapters": [
        589
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "relic-push-and-death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_purple_crystal_relic_gu",
        "gu_demonic_blood_skull_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan stages further painful experiments that briefly restore living flesh before it reverts, saying he is seeking a human recovery method. Chang Ji You consents to keep trying. When more Gu worms are forced in, his soul shatters and he dies floating motionless; Fang Yuan says he has killed him and that the death at least showed how stubborn the killer move’s flaw was.",
      "chapters": [
        590
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "relic-push-and-death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Six arms behind his back dance around chaotically. The skin on his arm turns back into living flesh and blood, and the six arms on his back slowly shrink, then the arm returns to the heavenly zombie state like a rotting log and the six arms grow back tougher and stronger. He looks very ugly. His eyes are crystal clear.",
      "chapters": [
        590
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "flesh-and-arms",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The fan translation writes Chang Ji You. No Chinese characters for the personal name appear in the English chapter text used here.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "translation-notes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
